# LuckyLogic Player configuration.
#
# Lives at /var/lib/luckylogic/player.conf on the installed machine, owned by
# the player user so the kiosk can read it and the setup screen can write it.
# Deliberately not on the EFI partition, which only root can read.
#
# Normally written by the setup screen, not edited by hand.

# The page the TV shows. Empty means "not set up yet", which sends the box to
# the setup screen instead.
URL=""

# Live screen viewing over VNC on port 5900. "on" for a box on the bench,
# "off" for anything in a studio, because it exposes the screen to anyone on
# that network.
VNC="off"

# Setup screen appearance: "dark" (default) or "light". The dark theme is the
# brand green; light is the same design on off-white for a bright room.
THEME="dark"
